    "title": "Morgantown Post 2 advances with win over Clarksburg Post 13 | West Virginia High School Sports | wvnews.com",
    "text": "BRIDGEPORT, W.Va. – University High School graduate Colson Jenkins did something Wednesday night that he has never done before.\nWith the score tied at two between Morgantown Post 2 and Clarksburg Post 13 during their second-round matchup of the Area 2 American Legion Baseball Tournament at Bridgeport High School, the Post 2 catcher smoked a 1-2 pitch from Post 13 hurler Chris Mazzei over the left field fence for a three-run homer which proved to be the winning score from Morgantown’s 5-2 victory.",
